Z||000010||Patrick||09-06-2000||02:30 AM||||<BR><B>wilb'u'rt</B>, is this the way you want it? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> Heheh, I realized the spelling error after I had posted. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> (And you can <I>hear</I> about Johnny's leak <I>here</I>.) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>By the way Wilburt, I haven't had any problems with my clutch for over a year now. Damn that ATF did a fine job! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><B>Johnny</B>, I'm not sure why there's flexible line near the master. It's possible that there IS some flex required at that point or maybe it's just to make installation of the line easier. ||||reg||14
